    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Good evening, ladies and gentlemen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(\"Hey!\")",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'd like to thank you all for joining us this evening",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Let me know if y'all with me, y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(\"Hey!\")",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Just a couple of things I wanna say...",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDBE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDBA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I only play the games that I win at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And stay the same, with more rhymes than there's ways to skin cats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "As a matter of fact, let me rephrase:",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "With more rhymes than ways to fillet felines these days",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Watch the path of the black one, the Supervillain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He wrecks clubs for delf in a drunken stupor, chillin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Ready and willin' to inadvertently foil that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Plan of the rhymer, they be whining like spoiled brat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Who got more snidey-er flows and snotty nose–",
          "rhyme": "oz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And holds mics like he knows karate body blows?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Nobody knows the trouble I see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "From the MPV fly dirty tailin' the bubble i30",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "For the record: this is some shit I just thought of, y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Science fiction that's not admissible (\"Hey!\") in no court of law",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I live to rock mics 3-D",
          "rhyme": "d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The only reason I seek to stop is– snuff the TV",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I heard beats, they sound like karaoke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "With monkey rhymers on a leash, like \"Don't have this fairy choke me\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Hit 'em with a penny, so we can get these peanuts",
          "rhyme": "9ts",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And I thought we was nuts; I used to get free cuts",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "They locks Lex Luthor up in Green Haven",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Since when, a nigga never really been too clean shaven",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Misbehavin' rap stars need Listermint",
          "rhyme": "int",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Call me Mista Bent, I'm at where your sister went",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Intelligent, used to write and be well-spoke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Now all a nigga wanna do is fight and sell—(\"Hey!\")—tell joke!",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "This could lead to catastrophe",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "'Bout to stop the violence, right after these last of three",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Shots from the black bat, got me at headlock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Holdin' on to sanity by strands of that dreadlock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "She told me, \"Get off!\" – I said \"Tsk... bitch!",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Let me set this shit off so I can get rich right quick\"",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Then it hit me like the point of intoxication (\"Huh?!?\")",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Nigga, come out and rock this nation like (\"Hey!\") ox defacin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "A lot of niggas out is rusty like oxidation",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "In this world's strangest, most dangerous occupation",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "But you could do it, you the Super like in your building",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Villian, like trife Kinder is, in All My Children",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Plottin' – and it's sure to pay ends",
          "rhyme": "End",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "With some real mature womens and some more of they friends (\"Hey!\")",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "When bad men roll tight, it's actual true",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Like a pack of big Bambú with natural glue",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Who grip necks of Becks to triple X?",
          "rhyme": "iks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "He just came from 4D, follow the ripple effects",
          "rhyme": "Ekt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "And it'll lead you right to him (\"Huh?!?\") – oh, snap!",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "It seems you walked into a trap through rap",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Zoinks! This place is filled with pretender willies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "One false move and get broke off like end of Phillies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "True believers, ain't nothin new to a–",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Crook with special powers like how to tell the future \"Uh-uh-...\"",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "'Rhyme Of The Month', two page long",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Bustin' off two gauges with my cape on wrong",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Son, it's on, remind me of a Raekwon tape song (\"Huh?!?\")",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "With a fleet of the super baddest, status: Rae Dawn Chong",
          "rhyme": "$N",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "Let me know if y'alls with me, y'all! (\"Hey!\")",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "National and geographic down to the titty-ball",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Rep Monsta Island City, y'all!",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "To all my brothers who is doin' unsettlin' bids",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "You could have got away if it was not for them meddlin' kids!",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "\"Over here!\"",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDDAAEFCCGFHIJKLMDDNOJJPIQQRSTDTTUVWOXXYZ[[CCA\\T]]^G_GA`a",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABCCAADDBBDDEFDGHICCBJDDKFKKBBLCLLBMMJIIBMAABBANLLLLDKDABF"
    },
